id: lesson.quality_tracking
category: lesson
status: verified
date: 2026-08-24
content: Quality must be measured, not assumed. Track test pass rates, artifact counts, and execution duration trends across cycles.
notes: |
  Metrics: test pass rate, number of artifacts created, execution time
  Trends matter more than single-cycle results
  Quality improvement is the goal of every self-improvement cycle
  If metrics are declining, the system should reflect and adjust
  Synthesis guidance should include quality recommendations
tags: [quality, metrics, tracking, improvement, trends]
